# 统一换行符策略：仓库内一律使用 LF，避免 Windows/macOS/Linux 检出不一致
* text=auto eol=lf

# 参赛声明文件必须与官方原文逐字节一致，锁定换行符不做任何转换
CONTEST_DECLARATION.md text eol=lf

# 明确二进制文件，禁止换行符转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 语言标注（影响 GitHub 语言统计与语法高亮）
*.py     text diff=python
*.md     text diff=markdown
*.json   text diff=json
*.html   text diff=html
*.yml    text
*.yaml   text
